[I] ROCm Application for Reporting System Info

[T] rocminfo is a ROCm command-line tool that queries the HSA runtime and
[T] reports information about the available CPU and GPU agents, such as
[T] their names, ISA, compute units and memory pools.

[U] https://github.com/ROCm/rocminfo

[A] Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[F] CROSS
[C] extra/development

[L] MIT
